  "name": "speed-control",
  "$comment": "Plan 9.1 (X2.5): the M2 speed-control variant of the dc-motor sample. The plant is the same iconic DC motor (VoltageSource -> DCMotor -> 1-junction with the rotor inertia and a RotationalDamper, R = 2 ohm, L = 0.5 mH, k = 0.05 N*m/A, J = 1e-5 kg*m^2, d = 1e-6 N*m*s/rad). The only code is the 1 ms discrete PI on the SpeedSensor: V = clamp(Kp*e + (Kp/Ti)*integral(e), -24, 24) with e = 100 rad/s - w, a reference step at t = 0.01 s. The error node is a 2-input inline block because the stdlib Sum takes one vector input that a JSON signal graph cannot assemble from scalar outputs.",
